CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract my_log
^\[my_log\.assigns\.\d+\] line 9 Check that g is assignable: SUCCESS$
^\[my_log\.assertion\.1\] line 10 body is reachable: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The wrapper of a variadic function under contract has to pass the write set
where the wrapped function has its write set parameter, and the harness has to
pass it where the wrapper has it. Otherwise n binds to the write set, the
requires clause cannot hold, and the body of my_log is unreachable.
